(a) The department shall have the power to administer and enforce all regulations and procedures adopted to implement this chapter, including the right to maintain an action or proceeding in any court of competent jurisdiction to compel compliance with or restrain any violation of this chapter, or to seek recovery of damages, fees or costs.
(b) The department can:
(1) Administer, coordinate and oversee conservation, acquisition, extension, improvement, design, construction, management, operation and maintenance of the DeKalb County Municipal Separate Storm Sewer System;
